    "summary": "The gospel comes both in word and in power.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Paul, and Silvanus, and Timotheus, unto the church of the Thessalonians which is in God the Father and in the Lord Jesus Christ: Grace be unto you, and peace, from God our Father, and the Lord Jesus Christ.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "Acts 15:34 (32–34); 2 Cor. 1:19; 1 Pet. 5:12."
          },
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "Acts 16:1 (1–2); 18:5 (1, 5); 1 Thes. 3:2 (2, 6)."
          },
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 39,
            "text": "JST 1 Thes. 1:1 … servants of God the Father and the Lord Jesus Christ, unto the church of the Thessalonians; grace unto you …"
          },
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 50,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Head of the Church."
          },
          {
            "start": 58,
            "end": 71,
            "text": "Acts 17:1 (1, 11)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 80
          },
          {
            "start": 103,
            "end": 105
          },
          {
            "start": 135,
            "end": 137
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "We give thanks to God always for you all, making mention of you in our prayers;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "D&C 46:32."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Remembering without ceasing your work of faith, and labour of love, and patience of hope in our Lord Jesus Christ, in the sight of God and our Father;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 46,
            "text": "1 Thes. 5:8; James 2:17."
          },
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 58,
            "text": "Heb. 6:10."
          },
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 80,
            "text": "TG Patience."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Knowing, brethren beloved, your election of God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "GR beloved of God, your election."
          },
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "TG Election."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For our gospel came not unto you in word only, but also in power, and in the Holy Ghost, and in much assurance; as ye know what manner of men we were among you for your sake.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "TG Gospel."
          },
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "1 Thes. 2:1."
          },
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "1 Cor. 2:4."
          },
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 64,
            "text": "TG Holy Ghost, Gifts of."
          },
          {
            "start": 77,
            "end": 87,
            "text": "TG Holy Ghost, Source of Testimony."
          },
          {
            "start": 128,
            "end": 134,
            "text": "1 Thes. 2:10; 2 Thes. 3:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "And ye became followers of us, and of the Lord, having received the word in much affliction, with joy of the Holy Ghost:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 23,
            "text": "GR imitators. Philip. 3:17."
          },
          {
            "start": 81,
            "end": 91,
            "text": "Acts 17:5 (5–10). TG Affliction."
          },
          {
            "start": 98,
            "end": 101,
            "text": "Acts 5:41."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "So that ye were ensamples to all that believe in Macedonia and Achaia.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "TG Example."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For from you sounded out the word of the Lord not only in Macedonia and Achaia, but also in every place your faith to God-ward is spread abroad; so that we need not to speak any thing.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 98,
            "end": 103,
            "text": "2 Thes. 1:4."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For they themselves shew of us what manner of entering in we had unto you, and how ye turned to God from idols to serve the living and true God;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 105,
            "end": 110,
            "text": "TG Idolatry."
          },
          {
            "start": 124,
            "end": 130,
            "text": "D&C 20:19."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "And to wait for his Son from heaven, whom he raised from the dead, even Jesus, which delivered us from the wrath to come.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "Acts 1:11 (9–11)."
          },
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 94,
            "text": "TG Deliver."
          },
          {
            "start": 107,
            "end": 112,
            "text": "1 Thes. 5:9."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 71
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
